# Pulsar layer change
#
# Pause the screw, do the UR travel move, resume. pulsar_pause() stops
# the daemon feeding chunks so the screw halts within ~one chunk — that's
# what breaks the bead between layers. No retract: on a screw extruder a
# few mm of E-retract does little against the melt volume, and skipping
# it keeps the layer change fast.
#
# Keep the travel move short — the barrel is still full and hot, so long
# dwells between beads risk ooze even with the screw stopped.

pulsar_pause()

# --- UR travel move(s) here ---
# e.g. movel(p[..], a=1.0, v=0.05, r=0)

pulsar_resume()
